<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Richway H1 share earnings, div up.</title>
<headline>Richway H1 share earnings, div up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per linked unit (cts) 26.33	 vs   24.04</p>
<p>    Div (cts)			    0.51	  vs   0.39</p>
<p>Pre-tax				0.39	  vs   0.40</p>
<p>    Interest paid			0.13	  vs   0.73</p>
<p>    Turnover			     18.837	vs   14.375</p>
<p>Full name:  Richway Retail Properties Ltd.</p>
<p>Div payable: March 14</p>
<p>NOTE - Richway chariman Alec Wapnick said earnings for the second half to June 30, 1997 are expected to be in line with the 55 cents unit forecast for the full financial year.</p>
<p>He said the construction of Waverley Plaza, a shopping centre in Villieria, Pretoria was progressing well and the anticipated completion date was July this year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
